extends layout

block content
  //- Landing copy introduces the platform before the user moves into the preview flows.
  h1 Welcome to Student Society Hub
  p Find and join societies at your university

  //- Search controls are currently visual only and act as the homepage search prototype.
  div.search-bar
    input(type="text", placeholder="Search societies...")
    button.btn Search

  br
  //- Primary call to action moves the user into the societies listing page.
  a(href="/preview/societies") View All Societies
